WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,980 --> 00:00:06,980
Who will come to Linnuo tomorrow?

2
00:00:07,580 --> 00:00:09,380
He grabbed the first share in front of all the British emperors

3
00:00:09,980 --> 00:00:10,980
stolen job

4
00:00:11,420 --> 00:00:12,500
You have to do it for me even more

5
00:00:13,820 --> 00:00:15,020
Chen Yao found me today

6
00:00:15,540 --> 00:00:16,780
One person will come one day

7
00:00:16,780 --> 00:00:18,100
All settled according to your rules

8
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:19,900
His body is almost gone

9
00:00:20,180 --> 00:00:21,260
Can't last half a month

10
00:00:22,460 --> 00:00:24,380
But he didn't play ball either

11
00:00:25,240 --> 00:00:31,260
What does it mean to drive a tough-minded person? The number of troops left empty-handed.

12
00:00:33,860 --> 00:00:34,900
That one tomorrow

13
00:00:35,060 --> 00:00:37,420
If you don't want to leave, take it out.

14
00:00:38,380 --> 00:00:44,120
You don’t need to ask me about this kind of thing. What about me, my account?

15
00:00:44,480 --> 00:00:45,480
It’s also one day a day

16
00:00:46,140 --> 00:00:47,180
You are walking at night

17
00:00:47,860 --> 00:00:48,820
Calculating accounts at night

18
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:55,660
Don't be soft-hearted tomorrow

19
00:00:57,380 --> 00:00:58,540
When have I ever softened my heart?
